---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Card from '../components/Card.astro';
import {stays,regions,regionSlug,demo} from '../lib/data';
---
<Layout><section class="hero"><div><p class="eyebrow">THE JAPAN STAY JOURNAL / VOL. 01</p><h1>Some places<br/>stay <em>with you.</em></h1><p class="deck">Beyond the itinerary, a different Japan.<br/>Discover the art of staying a little longer.</p><a class="text-link" href="/stays/">Explore the collection <span>↗</span></a></div><div class="hero-art"><div class="sun"></div><div class="ridge ridge-one"></div><div class="ridge ridge-two"></div><span class="vertical">旅の余白を、見つける。</span><span class="hero-caption">THE BEAUTY OF LESS<br/>An imagined landscape / OYADO studio</span><span class="hero-symbol">宿</span></div></section><section class="intro"><p class="eyebrow">A MORE CONSIDERED JOURNEY</p><h2>Not just somewhere to sleep.<br/>Somewhere to <em>be.</em></h2><p>We are building a journal of Japanese hospitality, shaped by place, people and the small things that make a journey memorable. {demo?'This first edition is a fictional preview of what is to come.':'Our first collection brings together five source-based guides from across Japan.'}</p></section><section class="collection"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">THE FIRST EDITION</p><h2>Places to pause</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/stays/">All stays ↗</a></div><div class="cards">{stays.slice(0,3).map((p,i)=><Card stay={p} index={i}/>)}</div></section><section class="region-band"><p class="eyebrow">FOLLOW YOUR CURIOSITY</p><h2>One country.<br/><em>Many ways to stay.</em></h2><div>{regions.map((r,i)=><a href={`/regions/${regionSlug(r)}/`}><small>0{i+1}</small>{r}<span>↗</span></a>)}</div></section><section class="editor-note"><span>拝啓</span><div><p class="eyebrow">A NOTE FROM THE EDITORS</p><h2>Good stories begin<br/>with honest details.</h2><p>{demo?'Every future guide will be grounded in traceable sources and reviewed by a person.':'Our guides trace practical details to their sources and pass through human approval before publication.'} Interviews will appear only after an actual conversation. Until then, we leave room for the story.</p><a class="text-link" href="/about/">How we work ↗</a></div></section></Layout>
